{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:PredictedSpectra.SchwingerMeasureUnit","@type":"LeanModule","name":"PredictedSpectra.SchwingerMeasureUnit","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Units.Basic"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchwingerMeasureUnit.canonicalUnit_density","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchwingerMeasureUnit.canonicalUnit_density","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/schwinger-measure-unit.lean#L61-L65","doc":"With the canonical unit the density is the reciprocal `s⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchwingerMeasureUnit.density_scale_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchwingerMeasureUnit.density_scale_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/schwinger-measure-unit.lean#L52-L59","doc":"The density satisfies the multiplicative scale-invariance functional\nequation `density ς (λ·s) · λ = density ς s` — the generic-ring face of\nthe `ℝ`-side uniqueness `SchwingerMeasureShape.scale_invariant_density_unique`.\nThe former `lam ≠ 0`, `s ≠ 0` hypotheses are now carried by the types. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchwingerMeasureUnit.canonicalUnit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchwingerMeasureUnit.canonicalUnit","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/schwinger-measure-unit.lean#L46-L50","doc":"The canonical Schwinger unit `ς = 1` — \"one nat per proper-time\ne-fold\" under `k_B = 1`. Canonicity is conjecturally backed (see the\nmodule docstring); this is a definition naming a construction, not a\nclaim. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SchwingerMeasureUnit.density","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SchwingerMeasureUnit.density","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/schwinger-measure-unit.lean#L40-L44","doc":"The Schwinger proper-time density with unit `ς`: `s ↦ ς · s⁻¹` — the\nfibre-level shape of the measure `ς·ds/s` (narrative symbol: `ς` is\nwritten `varsigma`; the audit lineage's `c` is register-reserved for\ncolor). The proper time `s` ranges over the units of `R`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:schwinger-measure-unit","label":"def:schwinger-measure-unit","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/schwinger-measure-unit.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}